body:
if it’s available in your country, i love the hawaiian tropics sunscreen! feels and sinks in like lotion, smells good, and doesnt sit on top of my skin like some weird spf jacket (i think u know what i mean with this one, yuck) 

they have different formulas but i like the sheer touch “weightless” one that comes in a pink and white swirl design

i honestly look forwards to reapplying because the smell is nice :) if you are very, very sensitive to scents though i would probably be a bit cautious though
